@startuml seq-snapshot-app
title Criação de snapshot dos repositórios dos grupos

actor "Usuário" as User
participant "Aplicação\n(Streamlit)" as App
participant "Coletor\n(GitDataCollector)" as Collector
participant "API\n(GitHub/GitLab)" as API
participant "SnapshotManager" as Manager
database "Armazenamento\n(Parquet/FS)" as Store

User -> App: Seleciona repositório e período
activate App
App -> Collector: collectAndCreateSnapshot(repo, período)
activate Collector

Collector -> API: getRepo(repo)
API --> Collector: dados do repositório
Collector -> API: listCommits(período)
API --> Collector: commits
Collector -> API: listPullRequests(período)
API --> Collector: pull requests

Collector -> Manager: createRepositorySnapshot(commits, pulls, meta)
activate Manager
Manager -> Manager: normaliza + valida + deduplica

Manager -> Store: gravar commits.parquet
Store --> Manager: ok
Manager -> Store: gravar pull_requests.parquet
Store --> Manager: ok
Manager -> Store: gravar metadata.json
Store --> Manager: ok + snapshotId

Manager --> Collector: snapshotId
deactivate Manager
Collector --> App: snapshotId
deactivate Collector
App --> User: Confirmação e link para artefatos
deactivate App

note right of Manager
Metadados registram: repositório,
período, contagens, carimbo de tempo,
versão de esquema.
end note

@enduml
